{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07339","headline":"奉寄婺州李使君舍人 · 刘长卿","name":"奉寄婺州李使君舍人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"建隼罢鸣珂，初传来暮歌。\n渔樵识太古，草树得阳和。\n东道诸生从，南依远客过。\n天清婺女出，土厚绦人多。\n永日空相望，流年复几何。\n崖开当夕照，叶去逐寒波。\n眼暗经难受，身闲劒懒磨。\n似鴞占贾谊，上马试廉颇。\n穷分安藜藿，衰容胜薜萝。\n只应随越鸟，南翥托高柯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07339.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07339","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}